<graph edgedefault="undirected"><node id="Anirach">
  <data key="d0">Anirach</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Anirach is identified as a university lecturer and AI engineer, affiliated with King Mongkut's University of Technology North Bangkok. Professionally, Anirach is involved in the RAG Second Brain paper, collaborates with Arthur on OpenClaw, and engages in healthcare AI projects in partnership with hospitals.

Anirach holds several ownerships and responsibilities, including a decision regarding the Prisma schema and the "Decision: Add Longevity Healthcare To Topic." Anirach is also designated as the owner assigned to an action item. Discussions pertaining to Anirach are tracked within the Knowledge Graph system, also referred to as the Topic Index.

Administratively, Anirach has benefited from the successful implementation of a complete academic research automation system by Workflow Automation, alongside a successfully integrated Google Calendar. Anirach has a confirmed preference to always reply in English and exhibits a predilection for dark themes in PPTX slides. The initial record for Anirach was created on 2026-02-16.&lt;SEP&gt;The person who requested the creation of the "White Paper for Executive Strategic Development Class".</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-2971afaa4a866697c2a2055c8cd288d2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2f77abe8ec47d9bbe58f0df8cc9c74c3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-33c82f85cdf1f3f6b459569c71f52f6d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-70c5932aa815cd6eef3ea2972206ea5b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a52871670ef07a5a1ba116162391d222&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c758a8c08dcaf507d7e3c18d75d2cefb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-31b6d14f3a78565ad12596af516da470&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-be6aab37bfb99aded14c2c91c9d5ad36&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7b3316dd810af55db2c42342b95d278e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4cfb904110c88a597561e8879c2ca0b9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d3ad29c3ef4ea9d4073b8f21e15af929&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7347a0c6ac17d9cb58ce4f8eb857eb12&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-113056c9501e9b2d79be577e20d93410&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f35a0c6a0244897333e1e1091f4a3eb2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8983e2b4c186fcc645136f51f241d354&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a738f505c3e1573b43b49a1c3bf45d9d</data>
