<node id="RAG Second Brain Paper">
  <data key="d0">RAG Second Brain Paper</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">The RAG Second Brain Paper is a research paper that proposes a multi-source Retrieval Augmented Generation (RAG) framework, specifically focusing on the application of multi-source knowledge graph RAG for medical diagnosis. This academic paper is currently under development by Anirach.

The paper holds an active status within the category of Research &amp; Papers. It was started on 2026-02-08 and last updated on 2026-02-10. Intended for submission to the AIiH 2026 Conference, the RAG Second Brain Paper has undergone a v23 revision to address reviewer concerns.&lt;SEP&gt;The RAG Second Brain Paper is an active research paper proposing a multi-source RAG framework.&lt;SEP&gt;An academic paper that is undergoing revision to address specific reviewer concerns.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-2971afaa4a866697c2a2055c8cd288d2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-19a30e0d2c5e415e011c673f18e44e91&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5a199a577367afc1799777199de40b72&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fa0b04516491978cd7f2fd3497bd74a6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e570c762971c4d1a558761ca3b304a6e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-505a6de49a4e71323e53e984bc770e7f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f483ffe5746e330a5d767b70d856c97b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-46d5184a8d46c47ab7401afbdefd9125&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cbbf68c07d5785152cb568cb44c097d2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1263f6dcbc96b0cd91f9ce4b885f6881</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
