  <data key="d0">AIiH 2026</data>
  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">AIiH 2026 is an event or conference for which the RAG Second Brain paper is being prepared.&lt;SEP&gt;An event to be held at Imperial College London from August 26-28.&lt;SEP&gt;The event or conference to which the RAG Second Brain Paper Project was submitted.&lt;SEP&gt;An event or conference to which the "RAG Second Brain Paper" was submitted.&lt;SEP&gt;A specific event or publication target associated with the RAG Second Brain Paper.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-2971afaa4a866697c2a2055c8cd288d2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-19a30e0d2c5e415e011c673f18e44e91&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c2cf3a796b09887b7b8355de43da736f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f483ffe5746e330a5d767b70d856c97b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-46d5184a8d46c47ab7401afbdefd9125</data>
