<node id="OpenClaw">
  <data key="d0">OpenClaw</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">OpenClaw is a software system or platform that serves as the operational environment for the AI agent known as Arthur. It is also a tool utilized by Anirach, frequently in conjunction with Arthur.

This software product represents the final name in a series of rebrands. Historically, it was known by previous iterations such as Clawdbot and Moltbot. The rebranding was prompted by trademark issues and a focus on security hardening, an area in which OpenClaw underwent significant enhancements. Additionally, OpenClaw has been the target of a migration, indicating its ongoing development and evolution.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-2971afaa4a866697c2a2055c8cd288d2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1bd439d8f06d579d7e29f33a3a379bf3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-698aa50ab28f0e3566cb6e574a6621f4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7b3316dd810af55db2c42342b95d278e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6a5125c828cf8928c4d9f36005ee5a06&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a4b9540765c9116547992f4b4a476e1a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5612c5c9efe47f2a4c36a48a45336086&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9d2f1db37d977a9d5337beaf2f8c2ada</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1772585350</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Arthur">
  <data key="d0">Arthur</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Arthur refers to two distinct entities.

One Arthur is an AI agent functioning as a personal AI assistant. This AI agent is characterized as a Labrador, or having a Labrador personality, and is sometimes visually represented by a dog emoji. Arthur operates on the OpenClaw platform and has a birth date of 2026-01-26. This AI assistant is primarily used by Anirach Mingkhwan and is actively involved in the RAG Second Brain project.

The second Arthur is a person, identified as an author and recorder of daily notes. This individual recorded daily notes on 2026-02-16, which specifically detailed the installation and configuration of LobsterBoard. Additionally, this Arthur authored a daily log entry for 2026-02-10.&lt;SEP&gt;An AI agent (Labrador 🐕) running on OpenClaw, born 2026-01-26, who assists Anirach Mingkhwan and works on the RAG Second Brain project.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-2971afaa4a866697c2a2055c8cd288d2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c2cf3a796b09887b7b8355de43da736f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0f077cc9ec87b144f1c492fa97cab376&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-698aa50ab28f0e3566cb6e574a6621f4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7b3316dd810af55db2c42342b95d278e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6a5125c828cf8928c4d9f36005ee5a06&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a4b9540765c9116547992f4b4a476e1a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d113e8b1edad4ebb129a2a094a883e18&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5612c5c9efe47f2a4c36a48a45336086</data>
