<node id="Anirach Mingkhwan">
  <data key="d0">Anirach Mingkhwan</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Anirach Mingkhwan is identified as a human individual and a Principal Investigator. Their identity details, affiliations, and projects are thoroughly documented within a Quick Reference document.

Anirach Mingkhwan is a lecturer at King Mongkut's University of Technology North Bangkok. As a Principal Investigator, they were responsible for the decision to build the ChartSense AI MVP. Furthermore, Anirach Mingkhwan is associated with a knowledge-graph and receives assistance from an individual named Arthur.&lt;SEP&gt;Anirach Mingkhwan is a person who is assisted by Arthur.&lt;SEP&gt;A person who is assisted by Arthur.&lt;SEP&gt;A human identity detailed in the Quick Reference document, identified by a Telegram ID and an email address.&lt;SEP&gt;A person who made the decision to build the ChartSense AI MVP.</data>
