<node id="Statistical Significance">
  <data key="d0">Statistical Significance</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Statistical Significance, with a p-value less than 0.001 (bootstrap), is a reported finding in the RAG Second Brain Paper v15.&lt;SEP&gt;Statistical Significance refers to the measure of probability that a result occurred by chance, noted as p &lt; 0.001.&lt;SEP&gt;Statistical Significance refers to the probability that a result or relationship is not due to chance, indicated by a p-value of less than 0.001.</data>
