<node id="UX/UI Designer Agent">
  <data key="d0">UX/UI Designer Agent</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">The UX/UI Designer Agent is an agent based on the Opus Model, added to the Coding Team, focusing on interface design, visual polish, usability, and responsive design. It uses Shadcn/UI and Tailwind CSS expertise, adhering to Anti-AI-Slop Design Principles, and is spawned for UI polish, new screens, UX reviews, and design systems.&lt;SEP&gt;A software agent or tool, powered by the Opus model, focused on interface design, visual polish, usability, and responsive design, and adhering to anti-AI-slop design principles. It is spawned for tasks like UI polish, creating new screens, UX reviews, and working on design systems.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-d395d729f7f4af176337bfefc3a79dd0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e4c9f0047cf0851b406258ad13a0ecf3</data>
