<edge source="Knowledge Graph" target="Obsidian">
  <data key="d7">12.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Obsidian is a prominent software application and knowledge management system that functions as a dedicated platform for a Knowledge Graph. This system is specifically designed to implement, manage, and host the Knowledge Graph.

Users leverage Obsidian to actively manage, organize, and interact with the content embedded within the Knowledge Graph. In essence, Obsidian provides the infrastructure and tools necessary to maintain and engage with the Knowledge Graph system.&lt;SEP&gt;Obsidian is the platform that hosts and manages the Knowledge Graph.&lt;SEP&gt;Obsidian is used to manage and host the files that constitute the knowledge graph.&lt;SEP&gt;The Knowledge Graph is managed or hosted using the Obsidian system.&lt;SEP&gt;Obsidian is a tool used for managing content within the Knowledge Graph.</data>
  <data key="d9">contains,content organization,hosts,implements,management,manages,platform,system,tool,tool for</data>
