<edge source="Obsidian" target="KnowledgeGraph">
  <data key="d7">9.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Obsidian is a software tool and platform that plays a comprehensive role in the management and implementation of the KnowledgeGraph. It functions as the application where various aspects of the KnowledgeGraph are contained, hosted, and organized.

Specifically, Obsidian is responsible for managing the KnowledgeGraph's overall structure, including its files and its index. It implements the KnowledgeGraph system and organizes its content. Furthermore, Obsidian is integral to the KnowledgeGraph structure, particularly within its "Topics" category, where it aids in organization and management.&lt;SEP&gt;The KnowledgeGraph content is managed within the Obsidian system.</data>
  <data key="d9">contained within,contains,hosts,implementation,indexed by,managed by,management,manages,organization,platform,structure,tool,utilizes tool</data>
